  "name": "두루누비(DMZ 평화의 길 공식 사이트): 자료실 > 공지사항 > DMZ 검색(제목)",
  "description": "두루누비 자료실 공지사항 제목 기준 DMZ 검색",
  "baseUrl": "https://www.koreadmz.kr",
  "startUrl": [
    "https://www.koreadmz.kr/geopark/pds/notice?searchCondition=TITLE&searchKeyword={keyword}"
  ],
  "scheduleTime": [
    "09:00"
  ],
  "enabled": true,
  "webhook": true,
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "step-001",
      "type": "detailLinks",
      "params": {
        "selector": "table.skinTb.skinTb-data-resList.skinTb-data-bgEven tbody tr td.skinTb-sbj a",
        "attribute": "href"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "step-002",
      "type": "scrapDetail",
      "params": {
        "targets": [
          {
            "name": "title",
            "type": "uniqueText",
            "selector": "div.contsArea.skinContainer div.skinTb.skinTb-data-resList.skinTb-data-bgSbj div.skinTb-tr div.skinTb-td.skinTb-sbj"
          },
          {
            "name": "writer",
            "type": "uniqueText",
            "selector": "div.contsArea.skinContainer div.skinTb.skinTb-data-resList.skinTb-data-bgSbj div.skinTb-tr div.skinTb-td.col2.skinTb-name"
          },
          {
            "name": "writedate",
            "type": "uniqueText",
            "selector": "div.contsArea.skinContainer div.skinTb.skinTb-data-resList.skinTb-data-bgSbj div.skinTb-tr div.skinTb-td.col2.skinTb-date"
          },
          {
            "name": "content",
            "type": "duplicatedText",
            "selector": "div.skinTb-td.skinTb-conts, div.skinTb.skinTb-data-resList.skinTb-data-bgSbj div.skinTb-tr div.skinTb-td.skinTb-conts"
          },
          {
            "name": "img",
            "type": "images",
            "selector": "div.skinTb-td.skinTb-conts div.skinMt-xsmall div.boGallery-img img, div.skinTb-td.skinTb-conts p img"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "step-003",
      "type": "paging",
      "params": {
        "selector": "#content div.contsArea.skinContainer div.pager"
      }
    }
  ],
